<newsitem itemid="250623" id="root" date="1996-12-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: NFC pre-tax profits rise in year.</title>
<headline>NFC pre-tax profits rise in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.3		    vs 6.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.6		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.1		    vs 7.1</p>
<p> Pretax preexcept	 105.7		  vs 76.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     105.2		  vs 38.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.46 bln	     vs 2.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 100.0 and 105.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - NFC Plc.</p>
</text>
